<%- include('../partials/top', { crumb: 'Help' }) %>
<div class="page-head"><div><h1>Help</h1><p>How CTENT works, in a few minutes.</p></div></div>
<div class="help">
  <section class="card">
    <h2>Every project is a journey</h2>
    <ol class="help-steps">
      <li><b>Question</b> — write what you want to find out, then split it into parts.</li>
      <li><b>Research</b> — each part goes to an AI agent or to a person on your team.</li>
      <li><b>Review</b> — tick the evidence you trust (agents) or approve the work (people).</li>
      <li><b>Write</b> — draft each section from your evidence; citations come with it.</li>
      <li><b>Finish</b> — run the health check, save the final report, share it on the showcase website.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="text-2">The coloured step at the top of each project shows where it is. The button next to it always takes you to the next step.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <h2>Agent mode or Manual mode</h2>
    <p class="text-2"><b>Agent mode:</b> AI agents search 21 free sources for each part and hand back evidence cards. Best for literature reviews and background research.</p>
    <p class="text-2"><b>Manual mode:</b> you give each part to a team member with a brief and a due date. They hand in their work and you approve it. Best for field work, lab work and group assignments.</p>
    <p class="text-2">You can switch at any time with the mode badge at the top of a project. Nothing is deleted.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <h2>Your Inbox</h2>
    <p class="text-2">Everything that needs you — evidence to review, join requests, work handed in — sits under <b>Needs you</b>. Messages, mentions, meeting invites and project updates are below it, with filters.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <h2>Shortcuts</h2>
    <p class="text-2">Press <kbd>/</kbd> anywhere to start a new research question. Press <kbd>Esc</kbd> to close it.</p>
    <p class="text-2">On a phone, swipe an evidence card right to keep it and left to skip it.</p>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-s btn-sm" data-reset-tips style="align-self:flex-start">Show the page tips again</button>
  </section>
</div>
<%- include('../partials/bottom') %>
